 "items": [
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText09",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText09",
   "en": "Stocking cards and using them\nin threes is much stronger\nthan using cards individually.\nGo on, give it a try.\nStock any three cards in your\ndeck.\nRemember, you need three\ncards or it won’t work.{END}",
   "max_units": 206,
   "units": 206,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText10",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText10",
   "en": "Stocking a Card\nPress the {HIGHLIGHT}L and R Buttons{PLAIN}\nsimultaneously.{END}",
   "max_units": 82,
   "units": 82,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText11",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText11",
   "en": "The sum of your three stocked\ncards becomes the value you\nplay.\nThe value is usually high and\nhard to break, and the combo\nattack deals a lot of damage.\nDon’t hold back.\nShow me what you can do.{END}",
   "max_units": 206,
   "units": 206,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText12",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText12",
   "en": "After stocking three cards,\npress the {HIGHLIGHT}L and R Buttons{PLAIN}\nsimultaneously to use them.{END}",
   "max_units": 106,
   "units": 106,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText13",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText13",
   "en": "Combo attacks aren’t the only\nbenefit of stocking cards.\n\nChoose your cards carefully\nand you can unleash special\nabilities called “sleights.”\nSleights come in all varieties,\nand each has its own unique\ncard combination.\nYou should try it out once\nyou've collected more cards\nand learned a sleight or two.{END}",
   "max_units": 321,
   "units": 321,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText14",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText14",
   "en": "But keep one thing in mind.\n\n\nEvery time you use a sleight,\nyou lose the first card you\npicked for the sleight.\nYou can’t reload it.\nThe lost card won’t return\nuntil the end of the battle.\nRelying only on sleights will\ncause your cards to run out.\nThat means trouble.{END}",
   "max_units": 283,
   "units": 283,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gMapSelectTutorialText0",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gMapSelectTutorialText0",
   "en": "To proceed to the next room,\nyou need a {HIGHLIGHT}map card{PLAIN}.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 73,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
