   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gMapSelectValueTutorialText3",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gMapSelectValueTutorialText3",
   "en": "Cards have marked values\nfrom 0 to 9.\n\n{HIGHLIGHT}Zero cards{PLAIN} (marked 0) are\nspecial cards which meet all\ncriteria.\nThe card without a marked\nvalue is a {HIGHLIGHT}Keycard{PLAIN}.\n\nKeycards are only used at\nspecial doors.{END}",
   "max_units": 242,
   "units": 242,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gSavePointTutorialText",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gSavePointTutorialText",
   "en": "The swirling crystal in front\nof Sora is called a {HIGHLIGHT}save point{PLAIN}.\n\nStand near it and press the\n{HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN} to open the save\nmenu.{END}",
   "max_units": 168,
   "units": 168,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gQuickSaveTutorialText",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gQuickSaveTutorialText",
   "en": "Aside from saving at a save\npoint, you can also {HIGHLIGHT}Quick Save{PLAIN}\nanywhere in the field.\nOpen the game menu by\npressing {HIGHLIGHT}START{PLAIN}, choose “Quick\nSave” and press the {HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN}.{END}",
   "max_units": 227,
   "units": 227,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gMapTutorialText0",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gMapTutorialText0",
   "en": "Striking objects in the field\nwith your Keyblade yields\nvarious results.\nTry striking the barrel.{END}",
